Description: LexOPS is a package for generating controlled matched items for factorial designs. Full documentation is available at <https://jackedtaylor.github.io/LexOPSdocs/>. There is a shiny app built with GUIs for most package functionality. The package is described in Taylor et al. (2020) <doi:10.3758/s13428-020-01389-1>.
